I have a question too!Grease Gun can stop all damage dealt by non-hero targets to hero targets even if Mister Fixer is an Isolated Hero, due to it messing with the villain. Gi Bunker&#39;s Panzer Buster does not stopp hero damage from being Irreducible on the chosen target if Bunker is Isolated Hero, even though Panzer-Buster is also altering the villain. Is there a difference between the two cards that I am missing?&nbsp;

